  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2ee87e681215b6147a44021cf30db039, type: 3}
  m_Name: 2.Merchant's Street
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  nameOfPoint: Merchants Street
  coordinatesPoint: {x: 14.513343, y: 35.89751}
  firstPartInfo: "I look at the busy street full of passersby. It\u2019s hard to
    imagine that a person was executed on this exact spot. Valletta has changed so
    much in a few years, let alone in two centuries. There are hardly any locals
    left, while many traditional shops are being closed down to be replaced by boutique
    hotels and hip restos. At least, the jewellery shops still exists. The precious
    stones provide a gleaming contrast to the scene that must have unfolded outside
    these windows more than 200 years ago. A poor, destitute conveyor forced to break
    quarantine to work and being punished for that. Was Borg really to blame? In
    his defence, he stated that he did not know about the rules that came into force
    on the first of August, as he\u2019d been in obligatory quarantine at the time.
    {hyperlink to reference, Peresso, p. 31)."
  secondPartInfo: "There is a specific place that the authorities had been using
    as the main quarantine centre back in 1813. It\u2019s not that far from Valletta
    - actually, you can even see it from its walls."
  imgMarker: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c98feaebd40d8df449e6d3855ac84352, type: 3}
  imgMain: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f26fa8880b3aeef4b8516c82dc12f2a5, type: 3}
  nameOfStory: Quarantine
  hintOfPOI: "(cat) I love lying around this place when it\u2019s sunny. I pick a
    vantage point overlooking the sea and let visitors pet me - only if their hands
    are clean, of course. When it sometimes rains, I visit the stone man reclining
    on a bed at the centre of the gardens."
  solutionOfPOI: "I\u2019ve heard humans call this stone man Lord Hastings."
